com,"ej,bradb102,P,sherj901,Call at HP"
com,"$Bradley ejected by HP umpire Sheridan for arguing"
com,"Hinchman was safe at home. Strange play: Tigers"
com,"thought Hickman (runner from 1st) was forced out at"
com,"2nd and therefore thought when Hinchman (runner from"
com,"2nd) was subsequently thrown out at home that this"
com,"was the third out in the inning and walked off field."
com,"Hickman then ran around the bases and scored (and"
com,"Birmingham ran around to 3rd) while the Tigers were"
com,"off the field."
